7280.description:
Attribute Reallocation Coupon.
This coupon must be acquired by the character who will be reallocating attributes.
Procedure:
1) Acquire and keep this ticket in the inventory of the character who will receive the change.
2) Send an e-mail to with the following information:
- Login;
- Name of the character whose attributes will be changed;
- Class and Base Level of the character (e.g. Knight 99);
- Server;
- Attributes to be reduced and their respective amounts, not exceeding 15 points (e.g. STR 5, AGI 4 and VIT 6 = 15 points);
- Contact telephone number in DDD + number format;
If the information does not match or is conflicting, the attributes will not be reallocated.
4) Wait for the GM team's analysis.
^FF0000PLEASE NOTE: After reallocating attributes, the Coupon will disappear from your inventory. A new reallocation can only be repeated after 3 months.^000000
^FF0000This item cannot be traded, dropped on the floor or placed in the cart, but it can be transferred to the warehouse.^000000
